    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your limits in the most frantic Neon Arcade Survival game in the galaxy! In Collisions, your reflexes will be pushed to the limit as you fight for survival in a fast-paced and intense arena against geometric enemies that move randomly and unpredictably.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collisions: Cosmic Galaxy is an indie project developed by me, Gabriel Henrique, with dedication to the indie gaming universe and the creation of visually striking and challenging experiences. The game is in its final stages of development\u2014stay tuned for updates!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Wishlist Collisions now and get ready for the ultimate neon challenge!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <u><strong>Simple Gameplay, Intense Challenge</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move using <strong>WASD</strong> or <strong>arrow keys</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/04eb88132f6afd7cd5f0f2c0a7831933.poster.avif?t=1752488817\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/04eb88132f6afd7cd5f0f2c0a7831933.webm?t=1752488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/04eb88132f6afd7cd5f0f2c0a7831933.mp4?t=1752488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/c3efeb3808b273ae7111ee34c82c0554.poster.avif?t=1752488817\" width=392 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/c3efeb3808b273ae7111ee34c82c0554.webm?t=1752488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/c3efeb3808b273ae7111ee34c82c0554.mp4?t=1752488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <u><strong>Dodge and Survive</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>dangerous red geometric enemies</strong> with unpredictable movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts\u2014stay focused!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/04c5672af8a1f3f2f3d517e624e0a616.poster.avif?t=1752488817\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/04c5672af8a1f3f2f3d517e624e0a616.webm?t=1752488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/04c5672af8a1f3f2f3d517e624e0a616.mp4?t=1752488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e <u><strong>Strategic Power-Ups</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab <strong>different diamond-shaped power-ups</strong> to boost your survival chances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them wisely and take control of the chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/a0da534a188b427d704cf1f783df83dc.poster.avif?t=1752488817\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/a0da534a188b427d704cf1f783df83dc.webm?t=1752488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/a0da534a188b427d704cf1f783df83dc.mp4?t=1752488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50 <u><strong>Collect Stars and Rack Up Points</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increase your score</strong> by collecting glowing stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep challenging yourself</strong> to beat your own records!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/a8d2fb7afb7c154e4ea3365f5038a8c7.poster.avif?t=1752488817\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/a8d2fb7afb7c154e4ea3365f5038a8c7.webm?t=1752488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/a8d2fb7afb7c154e4ea3365f5038a8c7.mp4?t=1752488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <u><strong>Global Ranking &amp; Exclusive Medals</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points to climb the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>exclusive medals</strong> that showcase your skill and persistence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0c <u><strong>Retro-Futuristic Neon Visuals</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>breathtaking neon experience</strong>, packed with <strong>dynamic particle effects</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic <strong>80s arcade games</strong>, with a <strong>modern neon twist</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/c44c87bfe0badddfb81294b629463a13.poster.avif?t=1752488817\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/c44c87bfe0badddfb81294b629463a13.webm?t=1752488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535800/extras/c44c87bfe0badddfb81294b629463a13.mp4?t=1752488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Short Description:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your limits in this frantic Neon Arcade Survival game!</strong> Dodge and survive <strong>dangerous red geometric enemies</strong> with random movements, unlock <strong>power-ups</strong> to boost your chances, collect <strong>stars</strong> to score, and climb to the <strong>top of the global leaderboard</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Easy to Play, Hard to Master</strong><br>\u2714 <strong>Collect Points and Stars</strong><br>\u2714 <strong>Stand Out with Your Score on the Global Leaderboard</strong><br>\u2714 <strong>Unlock Medals by Completing Challenges</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Are you ready to test your survival skills in geometric chaos?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Wishlist Collisions now and take on the ultimate neon challenge!</strong></p>",
